20:T36df,<h2><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6974 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/googles-ai-update-1.jpg" alt="" width="617" height="415" /></h2>
<h2>Introduction</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">The prevalent presence of AI (Artificial Intelligence) is spreading everywhere and is actively seen evolving various industries, jobs, applications, and social media. It is transforming how we see the world of technology with enhanced intelligence. With the emergence of AI’s prominent presence, here’s another update: the recent integration of AI in </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">Google’s search labs</span></b><span data-contrast="auto">.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/top-18-ai-tools-for-video-editing-and-creation/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18 Best AI Tools For Video Editing and Creation</a></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">This new feature of </span><b><span data-contrast="auto">Generative AI</span></b><span data-contrast="auto"> on Google is sure to transform the user experience, enhancing it more than ever with faster searches, useful insights, and content on the go.</span> <span data-contrast="auto">Although it’s a nightmare for <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/search-engine-optimization" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEO (Search Engine Optimization)</a> pros but a boon for users trying to find accurate and relevant information quickly.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2>Let’s understand how this feature of Search lab works:</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Just as AI helps you save time and effort, this feature will save you the hassle of scanning multiple sites by bringing more compact, efficient, and relevant data to you in an overview. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2>Steps to explore your Search labs:</h2>
<h3>Step 1:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Go to Google and make sure you&#8217;re logged in to your account.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h3>Step 2:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Click on the icon of Search lab.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="wp-image-6966  aligncenter" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/save-5.png" alt="" width="182" height="154" /></p>
<h3>Step 3:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Here’s an overview understanding of the AI’s overview on your search results. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6967 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/save-3-1024x340.png" alt="" width="660" height="219" /></p>
<h3>Step 4</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Remember to turn this feature on to enable it. However, turning it off will not disable the feature outside of Labs. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6968 size-full" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/save-3.2.jpg" alt="" width="465" height="65" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3>Step 5:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Now type your search query into Google’s search bar, just like you normally do. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h3>Example:</h3>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-6969 size-large" src="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/save-2-1024x359.png" alt="" width="660" height="231" /></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Powered by AI’s feature, Search Labs gives you an overview of the content related to your search.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">You will see your screen divided into two: one side shows the overview of your search generated through AI, and the other side on the right displays the relevant sites used to generate its information.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h3>Step 6:</h3>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">There you go—you have a compact result for your search, saving you the hassle of sifting through various sites to obtain your information. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<h2>Advantages of Google Search lab’s Integration with AI:</h2>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="1" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Multiple languages available</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="2" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">It also offers a listen feature to have your search results read aloud</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="3" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Compact search result</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="4" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Saves time of research </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li data-leveltext="" data-font="Symbol" data-listid="2" data-list-defn-props="{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}" aria-setsize="-1" data-aria-posinset="5" data-aria-level="1"><span data-contrast="auto">Easy to use</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></li>
</ul>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">A possible disadvantage is that it is still in the testing phase. Hence, it does not apply to all your searches. Since generative AI is new and incomplete, its availability and quality of results may vary.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/generative-engine-optimization-geo-key-factors-how-to-do-it/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Generative Engine Optimization (GEO): Key Factors &amp; How to Do It?</a></p>
<h2>A Hit of Wave to Your SEO Efforts!</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">As interesting and simplified as it is for users, it presents a wave of challenges for SEO professionals. They now have to compete more than ever to rank in the top results of the overview links.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">This change is going to affect CTR rates and search volume dynamically. It will also impact SEO strategies, requiring more quality content and adding to the competitive fight to top the search results. SEO will now need to focus on the specific intent behind users’ queries for more well-defined search results. However, SEO experts will navigate this challenge with smart strategies and comprehensive analysis.</span><b><span data-contrast="auto"> </span></b><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p>Also Read: <a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/5-important-seo-metrics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">5 Important SEO Metrics Which You Should Be Aware Of</a></p>
<h2>Conclusion</h2>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">It is no exaggeration or merely hype around the popularity of AI. It is constantly growing with necessary features and advanced support to make human life simpler and better.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">With every update, we climb the ladder of new technologies and advancements in various industries and sectors. Since this feature is still in the testing phase, it is likely to undergo a few more changes until its full integration. But it does seem promising to users.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Impulse digital – Digital marketing agency in Mumbai, provides its digital services across various sectors. We help your brand grow in the competitive market with exceptional digital marketing services. </span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">Our team makes sure your brand is always updated with the latest trends. To keep up with all the digital trends and updates read our blogs: </span><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/"><span data-contrast="none">https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/blog/</span></a><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="auto">To collaborate and work with us, Contact us on: </span><a href="https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/contact-us"><span data-contrast="none">https://www.theimpulsedigital.com/contact-us</span></a><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:6,&quot;335551620&quot;:6,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240,&quot;335559740&quot;:279}"> </span></p>
